body:
There are some problems that I faced using To do list, that I have never met using Wunderlist:
- The synchronization doesn’t go properly- I have a few shared lists and I do not see the updates that another user did, also I do not see updates I did on laptop. I have never had such problem with Wunderlist;
- I cannot share the link through To do list, I really liked this option in Wunderlist.
